         startHelpText = "Get to the finish beneath the start!";
         trivia = "Level created on July 7, 2022\nUpdates:\nAugust 13, 2026 - Added camera path and icon picture.\nAugust 13, 2026 - Added challenge times, hints, and trivia.\nTrivia:\nNot only is this a level where I put together the new things I learned about re-timing time travels, scaling platforms, and using signs, but I also figured out how to make and resize a bounds trigger in this level, and put together a course on many different gravities. I think this is an early example of my figuring out how to build levels.";
